hadiths[8]{hadithnumber,text}:
"138","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Husain bin Ali bin Yazid As-Suda'i Al-Baghdadi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Ya'qub bin Ishaq yani Al-Hadrami ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Shu'bah ne, Sufyan Ath-Thawri se, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, Abi Juhaifah se, kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Amma main, toh main takiya lagaye hue nahi khata. Hamain hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Bashshar ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Sufyan ne, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, isi jaisa."
"139","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Husain bin Ali bin Yazid As-Suda'i Al-Baghdadi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Ya'qub bin Ishaq yani Al-Hadrami ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Shu'bah ne, Sufyan Ath-Thawri se, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, Abi Juhaifah se, kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Amma main, toh main takiya lagaye hue nahi khata. Hamain hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Bashshar ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Sufyan ne, Ali bin Al-Aqmar se, isi jaisa."
"140","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Harun bin Ishaq Al-Hamdani ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abdah bin Sulaiman ne, Hisham bin Urwah se, Ka'b bin Malik ke ek bete se, apne walid se, kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam teen ungliyon se khate the aur unhe chaat-te the."
"141","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Ahmad bin Mani' ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Fadl bin Dukain ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Mus'ab bin Sulaim ne, kaha: Maine Anas bin Malik ko suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas khajoor laye gaye toh maine dekha ke Woh bhookh ki wajah se zameen par baith kar kha rahe the."
"142","[AI-translation] Mujhe hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Al-Muthanna aur Muhammad bin Bashshar ne, dono kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Muhammad bin Ja'far ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Shu'bah ne, Abu Ishaq se, kaha: Maine Abdur Rahman bin Yazid ko suna, jo Aswad bin Yazid se, Aishah se hadith bayan karte the, ke unhone kaha: Aal-e-Muhammad sallallahu alaihi wasallam jau ki roti se do lagatar din pet bhar nahi khaye yahan tak ke Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ko wafat na pahunch gayi."
"143","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Abbas bin Muhammad Ad-Duri ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Yahya bin Abi Bukair ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Hariz bin Uthman ne, Sulaim bin Amir se, kaha: Maine Abu Umamah Al-Bahili ko suna, kehte hue: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke ahl-e-bayt se jau ki roti bhi bachti nahi thi."
"144","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Abdullah bin Mu'awiyah Al-Jumahi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Thabit bin Yazid ne, Hilal bin Khabbab se, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam aur unka parivaar lagatar raton ko khali pait kaat-te the, unhein rat ka khana nahi milta tha aur unki zayada tar roti jau ki roti hoti thi."
"145","[AI-translation] Hamain hadith sunayi Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Ubaidullah bin Abdul Majid Al-Hanafi ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah bin Dinar ne, kaha: Hamain hadith sunayi Abu Hazim ne, Sahl bin Sa'd se, ke unse pucha gaya: Kya Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam naqi (safed gehoon ki roti) khate the? Yani huwara. Toh Sahl ne kaha: Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam naqi na dekhi yahan tak ke Allah Azza wa Jall ke pass pahunche. Unse pucha gaya: Kya Rasulullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke asr mein tumhare paas chhanne (manakhil) the?"
